## What Was Done

### 1. Root Cause Analysis

**Problem:** 80% of Nucleus orchestration dormant  
**Root Cause:** Infrastructure-first design without event emission  
**Solution:** Event-first architecture with automatic emission

### 2. Event Emission Instrumentation (Week 1)

**6 core functions now auto-emit events:**

| Function | Event Type | Status |
|:---------|:-----------|:-------|
| [brain_add_task](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/__init__.py#2550-2571) | `task_created` | ✅ |
| [brain_update_task](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/__init__.py#2537-2549) | `task_state_changed` | ✅ |
