**Result:** 201 events in stream, 15+ unique event types

### 3. Orchestrator Activation (Week 2)

- Fixed trigger matching (`type` vs `event_type`)
- Updated triggers.json with 8 routing rules
- Verified: 10 events processed, 10 agents spawned
- Daily digest generated successfully

### 4. Meta-Optimizer Activation

- Ran successfully: 30 agents analyzed
- Found 20 issues, generated 20 recommendations
- Logged to optimization_log.md

### 5. Cron Automation Setup

Created [scripts/setup_nucleus_cron.sh](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/scripts/setup_nucleus_cron.sh) with 4 scheduled jobs:

| Job | Schedule | Purpose |
|:----|:---------|:--------|
| Health Check | Every 6 hours | Monitor system status |
| Orchestrator | 9 AM daily | Generate digest, process events |
| Meta-Optimizer | Every 72 hours | Self-improvement cycle |
| Nightly Agent | 11 PM daily | End-of-day processing |

