## Remaining: Telegram Setup

**Status:** Bot token exists, needs chat ID

**User Action Required:**
1. Open Telegram
2. Find your Nucleus bot
3. Send `/start` or any message
4. Then run: `python3 scripts/telegram_briefing.py --get-chat-id`

---

## How to Use

### Manual Commands
```bash
# Health check
python3 scripts/nucleus_health_check.py --emit-event

# Run orchestrator
python3 scripts/orchestrator.py

# Run meta-optimizer
python3 scripts/meta_optimizer.py
```

### Install Cron Jobs
```bash
bash scripts/setup_nucleus_cron.sh
# Then: (crontab -l; cat .brain/meta/nucleus_cron.txt) | crontab -
```

### View Logs
```bash
tail -f /tmp/nucleus_*.log
```

